// 至尊牛牛 — 数据库 Schema（对应 PRD 第 8 章数据实体）
// 金额一律以「分」(cents) 存储为整数，避免浮点误差。

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

// ─────────────────────────── 用户与准入 ───────────────────────────

model User {
  id            String     @id @default(cuid())
  /**
   * HUMAN 必填；VIRTUAL 为空（无 Telegram）
   */
  tgId          BigInt?    @unique @map("tg_id")
  uid           String     @unique // 展示用数字 UID
  nickname      String?
  tgUsername    String?    @map("tg_username")
  tgDisplayName String?    @map("tg_display_name")
  avatarUrl     String?    @map("avatar_url")
  kind          UserKind   @default(HUMAN)
  status        UserStatus @default(ACTIVE)
  lastBotId     String?    @map("last_bot_id")
  /**
   * 后台客服/运营内部备注，不对玩家展示
   */
  adminNote     String?    @map("admin_note") @db.Text

  // 邀请关系（两级冗余，加速返水计算）
  inviterId      String?   @map("inviter_id")
  grandInviterId String?   @map("grand_inviter_id")
  inviterBoundAt DateTime? @map("inviter_bound_at")

  inviter  User?  @relation("Referral", fields: [inviterId], references: [id])
  invitees User[] @relation("Referral")

  device        Device?
  kyc           Kyc?
  wallet        Wallet?
  paymentPin    PaymentPin?
  virtualPlayer VirtualPlayer?
  createdAt     DateTime       @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt     DateTime       @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  bids              BankerBid[]
  bets              Bet[]
  claims            Claim[]
  settlements       Settlement[]
  bankerStats       BankerStat[]
  rewardGrants      RewardGrant[]
  rebateSettlements RebateSettlement[]
  depositOrders     DepositOrder[]
  withdrawOrders    WithdrawOrder[]
  withdrawAccounts  WithdrawAccount[]
  roomMemberships   RoomMember[]
  chatMessages      ChatMessage[]
  noticeReads       SystemNoticeRead[]
  groupPacketsSent  GroupPacket[]      @relation("GroupPacketSender")
  groupPacketClaims GroupPacketClaim[]
  agentProfile      Agent?
  agentBinding      AgentPlayer?

  @@index([inviterId])
  @@index([grandInviterId])
  @@index([kind])
  @@map("users")
}

enum UserKind {
  HUMAN
  VIRTUAL
}

enum UserStatus {
  ACTIVE
  BANNED
}

/// 互动群虚拟玩家（假人）：后台配置能力，调度器可自动参与竞标/下注等
model VirtualPlayer {
  id                  String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId              String   @unique @map("user_id")
  roomId              String   @map("room_id")
  enabled             Boolean  @default(true)
  canJoin             Boolean  @default(true) @map("can_join")
  canChat             Boolean  @default(true) @map("can_chat")
  canBid              Boolean  @default(true) @map("can_bid")
  canBet              Boolean  @default(true) @map("can_bet")
  canAllIn            Boolean  @default(false) @map("can_all_in")
  canBanker           Boolean  @default(true) @map("can_banker")
  canContinue         Boolean  @default(false) @map("can_continue")
  canThrowDice        Boolean  @default(true) @map("can_throw_dice")
  canGroupPacket      Boolean  @default(false) @map("can_group_packet")
  /**
   * 是否自动抢群内玩家发的红包
   */
  canClaimGroupPacket Boolean  @default(true) @map("can_claim_group_packet")
  canClaimSim         Boolean  @default(true) @map("can_claim_sim")
  /**
   * 0–1：本局参与竞标的概率
   */
  bidWeight           Float    @default(0.7) @map("bid_weight")
  /**
   * 相对庄池的下注比例下限（如 0.05 = 5%）
   */
  betRatioMin         Float    @default(0.05) @map("bet_ratio_min")
  /**
   * 相对庄池的下注比例上限
   */
  betRatioMax         Float    @default(0.2) @map("bet_ratio_max")
  /**
   * 可选聊天短语 JSON 数组
   */
  chatPhrases         Json?    @map("chat_phrases")
  targetBalanceCents  BigInt   @default(500000) @map("target_balance_cents")
  createdBy           String?  @map("created_by")
  createdAt           DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt           DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")
  user                User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  room                Room     @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([roomId, enabled])
  @@map("virtual_players")
}

model Device {
  id               String       @id @default(cuid())
  userId           String       @unique @map("user_id")
  deviceId         String       @map("device_id") // 前端指纹 + UUID
  authVersion      Int          @default(1) @map("auth_version")
  boundAt          DateTime     @default(now()) @map("bound_at")
  status           DeviceStatus @default(ACTIVE)
  /**
   * 最近一次玩家自助换绑时间：7 天内限一次，且换绑后 24 小时暂停提现
   */
  lastSelfRebindAt DateTime?    @map("last_self_rebind_at")
  user             User         @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@index([deviceId])
  @@map("devices")
}

enum DeviceStatus {
  ACTIVE
  UNBOUND
}

/// 账号级支付密码凭证；只保存加盐哈希及风控状态
model PaymentPin {
  userId         String    @id @map("user_id")
  hash           String
  isSet          Boolean   @default(true) @map("is_set")
  failedAttempts Int       @default(0) @map("failed_attempts")
  lockedUntil    DateTime? @map("locked_until")
  version        Int       @default(1)
  setAt          DateTime  @default(now()) @map("set_at")
  updatedAt      DateTime  @updatedAt @map("updated_at")
  user           User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@map("payment_pins")
}

model Kyc {
  id                   String    @id @default(cuid())
  userId               String    @unique @map("user_id")
  realName             String    @map("real_name")
  realNameHash         String?   @map("real_name_hash")
  duitnowId            String    @map("duitnow_id")
  duitnowHash          String?   @map("duitnow_hash")
  bankName             String    @map("bank_name")
  bankAccount          String    @map("bank_account")
  bankAccountHash      String?   @map("bank_account_hash")
  bankAccountLast4Hash String?   @map("bank_account_last4_hash")
  accountHolder        String    @map("account_holder")
  status               KycStatus @default(PENDING)
  rejectReason         String?   @map("reject_reason")
  reviewedBy           String?   @map("reviewed_by")
  reviewedAt           DateTime? @map("reviewed_at")
  submittedAt          DateTime  @default(now()) @map("submitted_at")
  user                 User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@index([status])
  @@index([realNameHash])
  @@index([duitnowHash])
  @@index([bankAccountHash])
  @@index([bankAccountLast4Hash])
  @@map("kyc")
}

enum KycStatus {
  PENDING
  APPROVED
  REJECTED
}

// ─────────────────────────── 钱包与账务 ───────────────────────────

model Wallet {
  id                  String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId              String   @unique @map("user_id")
  availableCents      BigInt   @default(0) @map("available_cents") // 可用余额
  freezeBankerCents   BigInt   @default(0) @map("freeze_banker_cents") // 冻结-庄池
  freezeBetCents      BigInt   @default(0) @map("freeze_bet_cents") // 冻结-下注
  freezeWithdrawCents BigInt   @default(0) @map("freeze_withdraw_cents") // 冻结-提现
  user                User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  updatedAt           DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@map("wallets")
}

model PlatformAccount {
  id           String      @id @default(cuid())
  accountType  AccountType @unique @map("account_type")
  balanceCents BigInt      @default(0) @map("balance_cents")
  updatedAt    DateTime    @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@map("platform_accounts")
}

model LedgerEntry {
  id                String          @id @default(cuid())
  userId            String?         @map("user_id") // 平台科目可为空
  accountType       AccountType     @map("account_type")
  direction         LedgerDirection
  amountCents       BigInt          @map("amount_cents")
  balanceAfterCents BigInt?         @map("balance_after_cents")
  roundId           String?         @map("round_id")
  refType           String          @map("ref_type") // bid/bet/unfreeze/settle_win/settle_lose/rake/fee_banker_seat/fee_service/fee_packet_agent/packet_create/packet_claim/refund/reward/rebate/adjust/deposit/withdraw
  refId             String?         @map("ref_id")
  idempotencyKey    String          @unique @map("idempotency_key")
  operatorId        String?         @map("operator_id")
  memo              String?
  createdAt         DateTime        @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@index([userId, createdAt])
  @@index([roundId])
  @@map("wallet_ledger")
}

enum AccountType {
  USER_AVAILABLE
  USER_FREEZE_BANKER
  USER_FREEZE_BET
  USER_FREEZE_WITHDRAW
  PLATFORM_RAKE
  PLATFORM_FEES
  PLATFORM_RESERVE
  TNG_TRANSIT
  PLATFORM_REWARD
  PLATFORM_REBATE
  PLATFORM_PROFIT_POOL
  ADJUST_CLEARING
}

enum LedgerDirection {
  DEBIT
  CREDIT
}

// ─────────────────────────── 充值 / 提现（人工确认） ───────────────────────────

/// 充值收款银行账户（后台可配置多个，并切换当前展示账户）
model DepositPayeeAccount {
  id          String             @id @default(cuid())
  bankName    String             @map("bank_name")
  accountNo   String             @map("account_no") // 加密存储
  accountName String             @map("account_name") // 加密存储
  label       String? // 后台备注，如「备用 / GX」
  isCurrent   Boolean            @default(false) @map("is_current")
  status      DepositPayeeStatus @default(ACTIVE)
  sortOrder   Int                @default(0) @map("sort_order")
  createdAt   DateTime           @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt   DateTime           @updatedAt @map("updated_at")
  orders      DepositOrder[]

  @@index([status, isCurrent])
  @@map("deposit_payee_accounts")
}

enum DepositPayeeStatus {
  ACTIVE
  DISABLED
}

model DepositOrder {
  id              String               @id @default(cuid())
  userId          String               @map("user_id")
  requestId       String               @map("request_id")
  amountCents     BigInt               @map("amount_cents")
  proofUrl        String?              @map("proof_url")
  payeeAccountId  String?              @map("payee_account_id")
  payeeSnapshot   Json?                @map("payee_snapshot") // 提交时银行/账号/户名快照
  status          OrderStatus          @default(PENDING)
  reviewedBy      String?              @map("reviewed_by")
  reviewedAt      DateTime?            @map("reviewed_at")
  rejectReason    String?              @map("reject_reason")
  createdAt       DateTime             @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  /// 支付渠道：MANUAL=玩家转账后人工确认；VPAY=第三方网关自动到账
  channel         DepositChannel       @default(MANUAL)
  providerTradeNo String?              @map("provider_trade_no") // 网关平台单号
  providerCode    String?              @map("provider_code") // 网关通道代码（trade_code）
  payUrl          String?              @map("pay_url")
  expiredAt       DateTime?            @map("expired_at")
  /// 回调返回的实付金额，与下单金额不符时不自动入账
  paidAmountCents BigInt?              @map("paid_amount_cents")
  /// 实际写入用户账本的不可变金额；冲正必须按此值撤销
  creditedAmountCents BigInt?          @map("credited_amount_cents")
  providerPayload Json?                @map("provider_payload") // 最近一次网关下单/回调原文留档
  providerCheckedAt DateTime?          @map("provider_checked_at")
  user            User                 @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  payeeAccount    DepositPayeeAccount? @relation(fields: [payeeAccountId], references: [id])

  @@unique([userId, requestId])
  @@index([status])
  @@index([channel, status])
  @@index([channel, status, providerCheckedAt])
  @@map("deposit_orders")
}

enum DepositChannel {
  MANUAL
  VPAY
}

/// 第三方支付通道商户配置（后台填写，密钥加密存储）
model PaymentProviderConfig {
  id                    String   @id @default(cuid())
  provider              String   @unique // VPAY
  enabled               Boolean  @default(false)
  baseUrl               String   @default("") @map("base_url") // 如 https://gateway.vpay.club
  traderId              String   @default("") @map("trader_id")
  apiToken              String   @default("") @map("api_token") // 加密存储
  tradeCodes            Json     @default("[]") @map("trade_codes") // [{code,label,enabled}]
  notifyIps             Json     @default("[]") @map("notify_ips") // 回调 IP 白名单，空=不限制
  /// 签名 dt 字段的时区偏移（分钟），马来西亚为 +480
  timezoneOffsetMinutes Int      @default(480) @map("timezone_offset_minutes")
  notifyUrl             String   @default("") @map("notify_url") // 留空则用 PUBLIC_API_URL 推导
  callbackUrl           String   @default("") @map("callback_url") // 留空则用 MINIAPP_URL 推导
  orderTitle            String   @default("Deposit") @map("order_title")
  minAmountCents        BigInt   @default(10000) @map("min_amount_cents")
  maxAmountCents        BigInt   @default(0) @map("max_amount_cents") // 0=不限
  updatedBy             String?  @map("updated_by")
  createdAt             DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt             DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@map("payment_provider_configs")
}

/// 用户提现收款账户（KYC 默认账户 + 用户新增，新增需审核）
model WithdrawAccount {
  id           String                @id @default(cuid())
  userId       String                @map("user_id")
  type         WithdrawAccountType
  institution  String // 银行 / 电子钱包名称
  accountNo    String                @map("account_no") // 加密
  accountName  String                @map("account_name") // 加密，通常为实名
  isDefault    Boolean               @default(false) @map("is_default")
  status       WithdrawAccountStatus @default(PENDING)
  source       String                @default("user") // kyc | user
  rejectReason String?               @map("reject_reason")
  reviewedBy   String?               @map("reviewed_by")
  reviewedAt   DateTime?             @map("reviewed_at")
  createdAt    DateTime              @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt    DateTime              @updatedAt @map("updated_at")
  user         User                  @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  orders       WithdrawOrder[]

  @@index([userId, status])
  @@index([status])
  @@map("withdraw_accounts")
}

enum WithdrawAccountType {
  BANK
  EWALLET
}

enum WithdrawAccountStatus {
  PENDING
  APPROVED
  REJECTED
}

model WithdrawOrder {
  id                String           @id @default(cuid())
  userId            String           @map("user_id")
  requestId         String           @map("request_id")
  amountCents       BigInt           @map("amount_cents")
  channel           String // bank | ewallet | duitnow（兼容旧单）
  withdrawAccountId String?          @map("withdraw_account_id")
  targetSnapshot    Json             @map("target_snapshot") // 提现时的收款信息快照
  status            OrderStatus      @default(PENDING)
  reviewedBy        String?          @map("reviewed_by")
  reviewedAt        DateTime?        @map("reviewed_at")
  rejectReason      String?          @map("reject_reason")
  createdAt         DateTime         @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  user              User             @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  withdrawAccount   WithdrawAccount? @relation(fields: [withdrawAccountId], references: [id])

  @@unique([userId, requestId])
  @@index([status])
  @@map("withdraw_orders")
}

enum OrderStatus {
  PENDING
  COMPLETED
  REJECTED
}

// ─────────────────────────── 多 Bot 与房间 ───────────────────────────

model TelegramBot {
  id        String    @id @default(cuid())
  name      String
  username  String    @unique
  token     String // 生产环境应加密存储
  status    BotStatus @default(ACTIVE)
  isDefault Boolean   @default(false) @map("is_default")
  createdAt DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  rooms     Room[]

  @@map("telegram_bots")
}

enum BotStatus {
  ACTIVE
  DISABLED
}

// 游戏房：对局在 Mini App 网页房间内进行；chatId/botId 为旧 TG 群绑定遗留字段（已弃用）
model Room {
  id                String             @id @default(cuid())
  gameCode          String             @unique @default("SUPREME_NIUNIU") @map("game_code")
  chatId            BigInt?            @unique @map("chat_id") // 已弃用：旧 Telegram 群 ID
  title             String // 由游戏目录决定，不允许作为普通互动群自由改名
  botId             String?            @map("bot_id") // 已弃用：旧群管理 Bot
  minPlayers        Int                @default(2) @map("min_players")
  status            RoomStatus         @default(ACTIVE)
  inviteLink        String?            @map("invite_link") // 已弃用：旧群邀请链接
  bot               TelegramBot?       @relation(fields: [botId], references: [id])
  rounds            Round[]
  members           RoomMember[]
  virtualPlayers    VirtualPlayer[]
  profitPoolBatches ProfitPoolBatch[]
  profitPoolCutover ProfitPoolCutover?
  createdAt         DateTime           @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@map("rooms")
}

model RoomMember {
  id         String           @id @default(cuid())
  roomId     String           @map("room_id")
  userId     String           @map("user_id")
  status     MembershipStatus @default(ACTIVE)
  lastSeenAt DateTime         @default(now()) @map("last_seen_at")
  joinedAt   DateTime         @default(now()) @map("joined_at")
  room       Room             @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id])
  user       User             @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@unique([roomId, userId])
  @@index([roomId, status])
  @@index([userId, status, lastSeenAt])
  @@map("room_members")
}

enum MembershipStatus {
  ACTIVE
  LEFT
  BANNED
}

enum RoomStatus {
  ACTIVE
  PAUSED
}

// ─────────────────────────── 对局 ───────────────────────────

model Round {
  id                  String     @id @default(cuid())
  roomId              String     @map("room_id")
  seqNo               Int        @map("seq_no") // 房间内局号
  phase               RoundPhase @default(WAITING)
  bankerId            String?    @map("banker_id")
  potCents            BigInt     @default(0) @map("pot_cents") // 庄池
  bankerReservedCents BigInt     @default(0) @map("banker_reserved_cents")
  isContinued         Boolean    @default(false) @map("is_continued") // 本局为续庄
  continuationUsed    Boolean    @default(false) @map("continuation_used")
  version             Int        @default(0)
  configSnapshot      Json?      @map("config_snapshot") // 开局配置快照
  bidEndsAt           DateTime?  @map("bid_ends_at")
  betEndsAt           DateTime?  @map("bet_ends_at")
  claimEndsAt         DateTime?  @map("claim_ends_at")
  statusMessageId     BigInt?    @map("status_message_id")
  cancelReason        String?    @map("cancel_reason")
  createdAt           DateTime   @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  settledAt           DateTime?  @map("settled_at")
  finishedAt          DateTime?  @map("finished_at")

  room           Room                 @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id])
  bids           BankerBid[]
  bets           Bet[]
  packet         Packet?
  claims         Claim[]
  settlements    Settlement[]
  scoreboard     RoundScoreboard?
  events         RoundEvent[]
  profitPoolLock ProfitPoolRoundLock?

  @@unique([roomId, seqNo])
  @@index([roomId, phase, seqNo])
  @@index([phase])
  @@map("rounds")
}

enum RoundPhase {
  WAITING
  BANKER_BID
  BETTING
  SENDING_PACKET
  CLAIMING
  CLAIM_EXPIRED
  SETTLING
  FINISHED
  CANCELLED
}

model BankerBid {
  id          String   @id @default(cuid())
  roundId     String   @map("round_id")
  userId      String   @map("user_id")
  amountCents BigInt   @map("amount_cents")
  won         Boolean  @default(false)
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  round       Round    @relation(fields: [roundId], references: [id])
  user        User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@unique([roundId, userId])
  @@map("banker_bids")
}

model Bet {
  id            String    @id @default(cuid())
  roundId       String    @map("round_id")
  userId        String    @map("user_id")
  amountCents   BigInt    @map("amount_cents")
  reservedCents BigInt    @default(0) @map("reserved_cents") // 最大赔付预留金
  isAllIn       Boolean   @default(false) @map("is_all_in") // 梭哈
  status        BetStatus @default(FROZEN)
  revision      Int       @default(0)
  createdAt     DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  round         Round     @relation(fields: [roundId], references: [id])
  user          User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@unique([roundId, userId])
  @@map("bets")
}

enum BetStatus {
  FROZEN
  WITHDRAWN // 发0撤回
  SETTLED
  REFUNDED
  FORFEITED
}

model RoundEvent {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  roundId   String   @map("round_id")
  type      String
  payload   Json?
  actorId   String?  @map("actor_id")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  round     Round    @relation(fields: [roundId], references: [id])

  @@index([roundId, createdAt])
  @@map("round_events")
}

// ─────────────────────────── TNG 红包与认额 ───────────────────────────

model Packet {
  id               String        @id @default(cuid())
  roundId          String        @unique @map("round_id")
  channel          PacketChannel @default(TNG) // TNG=外部链接抢包；INTERNAL=小助手直发、余额入账
  packerAccount    String?       @map("packer_account") // 发包 TNG 账号标识
  claimUrl         String?       @map("claim_url")
  deepLink         String?       @map("deep_link") // tngdwallet:// 深链，https 分享链打不开时兜底
  totalCents       BigInt        @map("total_cents")
  participantCount Int           @map("participant_count")
  status           PacketStatus  @default(CREATED)
  createdAt        DateTime      @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  sentAt           DateTime?     @map("sent_at")
  expiresAt        DateTime?     @map("expires_at")
  reconciledCents  BigInt        @default(0) @map("reconciled_cents")
  returnedCents    BigInt        @default(0) @map("returned_cents")

  // ── 手机端自动建包（TNG ingest）──
  correlation      String?   @unique // 派单短码：手机端写入红包祝福语并原样回传，用于关联本局
  ingestDeviceId   String?   @map("ingest_device_id") // 当前持有派单租约的采集设备
  ingestLeaseUntil DateTime? @map("ingest_lease_until") // 租约到期前不再派给其它设备

  round      Round           @relation(fields: [roundId], references: [id])
  claims     Claim[]
  claimInbox TngClaimInbox[]

  @@map("packets")
}

enum PacketChannel {
  TNG // 系统外 TNG 链接，抢包在 TNG 客户端完成，金额靠后台录入
  INTERNAL // 系统内红包：小助手直发，抢包金额随机拆分并直接入余额
}

enum PacketStatus {
  CREATED
  SENT
  EXPIRED
  CANCELLED
  RECONCILED
}

model Claim {
  id          String      @id @default(cuid())
  packetId    String      @map("packet_id")
  roundId     String      @map("round_id")
  userId      String      @map("user_id")
  amountCents BigInt      @map("amount_cents") // 抢到金额（仅用于牌型）
  tngName     String?     @map("tng_name") // 领取明细中的 TNG 姓名
  handType    String?     @map("hand_type")
  points      Int?
  source      ClaimSource @default(MANUAL) // MANUAL=后台录入
  enteredBy   String?     @map("entered_by") // 录入运营
  confirmedAt DateTime?   @map("confirmed_at")
  createdAt   DateTime    @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  packet Packet @relation(fields: [packetId], references: [id])
  round  Round  @relation(fields: [roundId], references: [id])
  user   User   @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@unique([roundId, userId]) // 幂等：同局同人只认额一次
  @@index([userId, createdAt])
  @@map("claims")
}

model TngAccount {
  id                String   @id @default(cuid())
  label             String
  accountName       String   @map("account_name")
  maskedId          String?  @map("masked_id")
  status            String   @default("ACTIVE")
  monthlyLimitCents BigInt?  @map("monthly_limit_cents")
  notes             String?
  createdAt         DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt         DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@map("tng_accounts")
}

/**
 * 手机端回传的领取明细中，无法自动匹配到玩家的记录（同名歧义、未实名、姓名不在本局参与者内）。
 * 运营在后台人工指认后再落成 Claim，避免自动记账把钱算到错误账号上。
 */
model TngClaimInbox {
  id          String              @id @default(cuid())
  packetId    String              @map("packet_id")
  roundId     String              @map("round_id")
  tngName     String              @map("tng_name") // 加密存储
  tngNameHash String              @map("tng_name_hash") // 盲索引，便于按姓名检索
  amountCents BigInt              @map("amount_cents")
  claimedAt   DateTime            @map("claimed_at")
  deviceId    String?             @map("device_id")
  status      TngClaimInboxStatus @default(PENDING)
  reason      String? // NAME_NOT_MATCHED / NAME_AMBIGUOUS / KYC_NOT_APPROVED / ...
  resolvedBy  String?             @map("resolved_by")
  resolvedAt  DateTime?           @map("resolved_at")
  claimId     String?             @map("claim_id") // 人工指认后生成的 Claim
  createdAt   DateTime            @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  packet Packet @relation(fields: [packetId], references: [id])

  // 同名同额可能属于两个不同参与者；采集端重试会保留相同领取时间。
  @@unique([packetId, tngNameHash, amountCents, claimedAt])
  @@index([status, createdAt])
  @@map("tng_claim_inbox")
}

enum TngClaimInboxStatus {
  PENDING
  RESOLVED
  DISCARDED
}

enum ClaimSource {
  MANUAL
  PROVIDER // 手机端采集回调自动认额
  AUTO_TAIL // 自动认尾包：抢包超时后系统补录尾包金额
  INTERNAL // 内部红包：玩家在系统内抢包，金额随机拆分并直接入余额
}

// ─────────────────────────── 结算 ───────────────────────────

model Settlement {
  id                String        @id @default(cuid())
  roundId           String        @map("round_id")
  userId            String        @map("user_id") // 闲家
  betCents          BigInt        @map("bet_cents")
  bankerAmountCents BigInt        @map("banker_amount_cents")
  playerAmountCents BigInt        @map("player_amount_cents")
  bankerHand        String        @map("banker_hand")
  playerHand        String        @map("player_hand")
  bankerPoints      Int           @map("banker_points")
  playerPoints      Int           @map("player_points")
  outcome           SettleOutcome
  isBustPlayer      Boolean       @default(false) @map("is_bust_player")
  isBustBanker      Boolean       @default(false) @map("is_bust_banker")
  multiplier        Int           @default(1)
  payableCents      BigInt        @default(0) @map("payable_cents")
  paidCents         BigInt        @default(0) @map("paid_cents")
  shortfallCents    BigInt        @default(0) @map("shortfall_cents")
  rakeCents         BigInt        @default(0) @map("rake_cents")
  createdAt         DateTime      @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  round Round @relation(fields: [roundId], references: [id])
  user  User  @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@unique([roundId, userId])
  @@map("settlements")
}

enum SettleOutcome {
  PLAYER_WIN
  BANKER_WIN
  TIE
  VOID
}

model RoundScoreboard {
  id                      String                    @id @default(cuid())
  roundId                 String                    @unique @map("round_id")
  seqNo                   Int                       @map("seq_no")
  playerLines             Json                      @map("player_lines")
  bankerSummary           Json                      @map("banker_summary") // 含费用/庄盈亏/走势
  publishedMessageId      BigInt?                   @map("published_message_id")
  presentation            Json?
  presentationRevision    Int                       @default(0) @map("presentation_revision")
  presentationUpdatedBy   String?                   @map("presentation_updated_by")
  presentationSyncStatus  ScoreboardSyncStatus      @default(LEGACY) @map("presentation_sync_status")
  presentationSyncError   String?                   @map("presentation_sync_error")
  presentationSyncedAt    DateTime?                 @map("presentation_synced_at")
  publishedChatMessageIds Json                      @default("[]") @map("published_chat_message_ids")
  createdAt               DateTime                  @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt               DateTime                  @updatedAt @map("updated_at")
  round                   Round                     @relation(fields: [roundId], references: [id])
  presentationRevisions   RoundScoreboardRevision[]

  @@map("round_scoreboards")
}

enum ScoreboardSyncStatus {
  LEGACY
  PENDING
  SYNCED
  FAILED
  MESSAGE_EXPIRED
}

model RoundScoreboardRevision {
  id             String          @id @default(cuid())
  scoreboardId   String          @map("scoreboard_id")
  revision       Int
  presentation   Json
  renderedChunks Json            @default("[]") @map("rendered_chunks")
  reason         String
  adminId        String          @map("admin_id")
  createdAt      DateTime        @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  scoreboard     RoundScoreboard @relation(fields: [scoreboardId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([scoreboardId, revision])
  @@index([adminId, createdAt])
  @@map("round_scoreboard_revisions")
}

model BankerStat {
  id               String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId           String   @map("user_id")
  roomId           String   @map("room_id")
  totalProfitCents BigInt   @default(0) @map("total_profit_cents") // 庄总积分
  roundsAsBanker   Int      @default(0) @map("rounds_as_banker") // 打桩次数（累计）
  roundsToday      Int      @default(0) @map("rounds_today")
  todayDate        String?  @map("today_date") // YYYY-MM-DD
  trendRecent      Json     @default("[]") @map("trend_recent") // 最近N局牌型/点数
  updatedAt        DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")
  user             User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@unique([userId, roomId])
  @@map("banker_stats")
}

// ─────────────────────────── 奖励 / 排行榜 / 返水 ───────────────────────────

model RewardConfig {
  id          String        @id @default(cuid())
  gameCode    String        @default("SUPREME_NIUNIU") @map("game_code")
  tab         RewardTab
  code        String // guai_pai / baozi_king / manniu_king / shunzi_king / fanshun_king / banker_ladder_18 / banker_instant_kill / special_xxx
  title       String
  conditions  Json // 牌型组合/次数/门槛等
  amountCents BigInt        @map("amount_cents")
  dailyQuota  Int           @default(0) @map("daily_quota") // 0=不限量
  status      String        @default("ACTIVE")
  createdAt   DateTime      @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  grants      RewardGrant[]

  @@unique([gameCode, code])
  @@index([gameCode, status])
  @@map("reward_configs")
}

enum RewardTab {
  CHESS // 棋牌奖励
  BANKER // 庄家奖励
  SPECIAL // 特别奖励
}

model RewardGrant {
  id          String       @id @default(cuid())
  configId    String       @map("config_id")
  userId      String       @map("user_id")
  date        String // YYYY-MM-DD
  amountCents BigInt       @map("amount_cents")
  ledgerRef   String?      @map("ledger_ref")
  grantedAt   DateTime     @default(now()) @map("granted_at")
  config      RewardConfig @relation(fields: [configId], references: [id])
  user        User         @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@unique([configId, userId, date])
  @@map("reward_grants")
}

model DailyHandProgress {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  gameCode  String   @default("SUPREME_NIUNIU") @map("game_code")
  userId    String   @map("user_id")
  date      String // YYYY-MM-DD
  counts    Json     @default("{}") // {baozi:1, shunzi:2, ...}
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@unique([gameCode, userId, date])
  @@index([gameCode, date])
  @@map("daily_hand_progress")
}

model TurnoverDaily {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  gameCode  String   @default("SUPREME_NIUNIU") @map("game_code")
  userId    String   @map("user_id")
  date      String // YYYY-MM-DD
  selfCents BigInt   @default(0) @map("self_cents")
  l1Cents   BigInt   @default(0) @map("l1_cents")
  l2Cents   BigInt   @default(0) @map("l2_cents")
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@unique([gameCode, userId, date])
  @@index([gameCode, date])
  @@map("turnover_daily")
}

model RebateSettlement {
  id              String   @id @default(cuid())
  gameCode        String   @default("SUPREME_NIUNIU") @map("game_code")
  userId          String   @map("user_id")
  date            String
  selfCents       BigInt   @map("self_cents")
  l1Cents         BigInt   @map("l1_cents")
  l2Cents         BigInt   @map("l2_cents")
  ratesSnapshot   Json     @map("rates_snapshot")
  commissionCents BigInt   @map("commission_cents")
  status          String   @default("PAID")
  ledgerRef       String?  @map("ledger_ref")
  createdAt       DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  user            User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@unique([gameCode, userId, date])
  @@index([gameCode, date])
  @@map("rebate_settlements")
}

// ─────────────────────── 利润池与称桶分配（代理/股东分成） ───────────────────────

/// 代理/股东：绑定一个平台用户账号接收称桶分成
model Agent {
  id            String      @id @default(cuid())
  userId        String      @unique @map("user_id")
  user          User        @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  /// 后台展示名（如 A代理 / 股东-张三）
  label         String
  /// 称桶占成点数：实得比例 = sharePoints ÷ 称桶基准(默认130)。65 点 → 50%
  sharePoints   Int         @map("share_points")
  status        AgentStatus @default(ACTIVE)
  /// 上级代理（null = 第一层代理，仅后台可建）；下级占成须 ≤ 上级占成 − 最低预留点数
  parentAgentId String?     @map("parent_agent_id")
  parent        Agent?      @relation("AgentTree", fields: [parentAgentId], references: [id])
  children      Agent[]     @relation("AgentTree")
  /// 建立者：ADMIN（后台）或上级代理的 agentId（前台升级）
  createdBy     String?     @map("created_by")
  createdAt     DateTime    @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt     DateTime    @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  players AgentPlayer[]
  shares  AgentProfitShare[]

  @@index([status])
  @@index([parentAgentId])
  @@map("agents")
}

enum AgentStatus {
  ACTIVE
  DISABLED
}

/// 玩家归属：一个玩家最多归属一个代理，其有效流水计入该代理的贡献
model AgentPlayer {
  id      String   @id @default(cuid())
  agentId String   @map("agent_id")
  userId  String   @unique @map("user_id")
  agent   Agent    @relation(fields: [agentId], references: [id])
  user    User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])
  boundAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("bound_at")
  boundBy String?  @map("bound_by")
  /// 归属来源：MANUAL 后台手动绑定 / REFERRAL 推荐码注册自动归属
  source  String   @default("MANUAL")

  @@index([agentId])
  @@map("agent_players")
}

/// 每日利润池：抽水收入 − 公司支出（流水×比例）± 负结转 = 净利润池
model ProfitPoolDaily {
  id   String @id @default(cuid())
  date String @unique // YYYY-MM-DD（马来西亚时区）

  /// 玩家赢抽水（当日实收）
  rakePlayerCents BigInt @default(0) @map("rake_player_cents")
  /// 庄家赢抽水（当日实收）
  rakeBankerCents BigInt @default(0) @map("rake_banker_cents")
  rakeTotalCents  BigInt @map("rake_total_cents")
  /// 公司总流水（全体用户当日有效下注合计，口径与推广返水一致）
  turnoverCents   BigInt @map("turnover_cents")

  expenseRatioSnapshot Float  @map("expense_ratio_snapshot")
  expenseCents         BigInt @map("expense_cents")
  /// 前一日负结转（≤0）
  carryInCents         BigInt @default(0) @map("carry_in_cents")
  /// 净利润池 = 抽水 − 支出 + 负结转
  netPoolCents         BigInt @map("net_pool_cents")
  /// 实际分给代理的合计
  distributedCents     BigInt @default(0) @map("distributed_cents")
  /// 公司留存 = 净池 − 分配合计（净池为正时）
  residualCents        BigInt @default(0) @map("residual_cents")
  /// 结转到次日的负额（净池 ≤ 0 时 = 净池，否则 0）
  carryOutCents        BigInt @default(0) @map("carry_out_cents")
  bucketBaseSnapshot   Int    @map("bucket_base_snapshot")

  /// PENDING（报表已生成待确认）| SETTLED（已确认发放）| NO_DISTRIBUTION（负池不分配）
  status      String    @default("SETTLED")
  settledBy   String?   @map("settled_by")
  confirmedBy String?   @map("confirmed_by")
  confirmedAt DateTime? @map("confirmed_at")
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  shares AgentProfitShare[]

  @@index([date])
  @@map("profit_pool_daily")
}

/// 代理称桶分配明细（占成差额制）：
/// 自身利润 = 净池 × (直属玩家流水 ÷ 公司流水) × (占成 ÷ 基准)
/// 差额利润 = Σ 净池 × (直属下级团队流水 ÷ 公司流水) × ((自身占成 − 下级占成) ÷ 基准)
model AgentProfitShare {
  id      String          @id @default(cuid())
  poolId  String          @map("pool_id")
  pool    ProfitPoolDaily @relation(fields: [poolId], references: [id])
  agentId String          @map("agent_id")
  agent   Agent           @relation(fields: [agentId], references: [id])
  date    String

  /// 自身流水（直属玩家 + 代理本人）
  turnoverCents        BigInt   @map("turnover_cents")
  /// 团队流水（自身流水 + 所有下级代理团队流水）
  teamTurnoverCents    BigInt   @default(0) @map("team_turnover_cents")
  companyTurnoverCents BigInt   @map("company_turnover_cents")
  sharePointsSnapshot  Int      @map("share_points_snapshot")
  bucketBaseSnapshot   Int      @map("bucket_base_snapshot")
  /// 自身称桶利润
  selfAmountCents      BigInt   @default(0) @map("self_amount_cents")
  /// 下级差额利润合计
  overrideAmountCents  BigInt   @default(0) @map("override_amount_cents")
  /// 合计 = 自身 + 差额
  amountCents          BigInt   @map("amount_cents")
  /// 直属下级差额明细快照 [{agentId,label,uid,points,diffPoints,teamTurnoverCents,amountCents}]
  breakdown            Json?
  ledgerRef            String?  @map("ledger_ref")
  createdAt            DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@unique([date, agentId])
  @@index([agentId, date])
  @@map("agent_profit_shares")
}

/// 新版称桶利润池：以单一房间内的连续局号闭区间为正式结算单位。
/// 旧 ProfitPoolDaily/AgentProfitShare 仅保留为历史，不再产生新记录。
model ProfitPoolBatch {
  id       String @id @default(cuid())
  poolCode String @unique @map("pool_code")

  roomId              String @map("room_id")
  room                Room   @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id])
  startSeqNo          Int    @map("start_seq_no")
  endSeqNo            Int    @map("end_seq_no")
  roundCount          Int    @map("round_count")
  finishedRoundCount  Int    @map("finished_round_count")
  cancelledRoundCount Int    @default(0) @map("cancelled_round_count")

  /// 流水沿用游戏有效流水口径：闲家有效注 + 庄家对应对赌流水。
  turnoverPlayerCents BigInt @default(0) @map("turnover_player_cents")
  turnoverBankerCents BigInt @default(0) @map("turnover_banker_cents")
  turnoverCents       BigInt @map("turnover_cents")
  rakePlayerCents     BigInt @default(0) @map("rake_player_cents")
  rakeBankerCents     BigInt @default(0) @map("rake_banker_cents")
  rakeTotalCents      BigInt @map("rake_total_cents")

  /// 支出百分比以万分点存储：100 = 1%，10000 = 100%。
  expenseBps         Int    @map("expense_bps")
  expenseCents       BigInt @map("expense_cents")
  netPoolCents       BigInt @map("net_pool_cents")
  distributedCents   BigInt @default(0) @map("distributed_cents")
  residualCents      BigInt @default(0) @map("residual_cents")
  bucketBaseSnapshot Int    @map("bucket_base_snapshot")
  calculationHash    String @map("calculation_hash")

  status        ProfitPoolBatchStatus @default(PENDING)
  generatedBy   String                @map("generated_by")
  generatedAt   DateTime              @default(now()) @map("generated_at")
  distributedBy String?               @map("distributed_by")
  distributedAt DateTime?             @map("distributed_at")

  roundLocks      ProfitPoolRoundLock[]
  agentSnapshots  ProfitPoolAgentSnapshot[]
  playerSnapshots ProfitPoolPlayerSnapshot[]

  @@index([roomId, startSeqNo, endSeqNo])
  @@index([status, generatedAt])
  @@index([generatedAt])
  @@map("profit_pool_batches")
}

enum ProfitPoolBatchStatus {
  PENDING
  DISTRIBUTED
  NO_DISTRIBUTION
}

/// 每个真实 Round 只能出现一次；该唯一约束是并发生成时的最终防重边界。
model ProfitPoolRoundLock {
  id                 String          @id @default(cuid())
  poolId             String          @map("pool_id")
  pool               ProfitPoolBatch @relation(fields: [poolId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  roundId            String          @unique @map("round_id")
  round              Round           @relation(fields: [roundId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  roomId             String          @map("room_id")
  seqNo              Int             @map("seq_no")
  phaseSnapshot      String          @map("phase_snapshot")
  finishedAtSnapshot DateTime?       @map("finished_at_snapshot")
  createdAt          DateTime        @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@unique([roomId, seqNo])
  @@index([poolId, seqNo])
  @@map("profit_pool_round_locks")
}

/// 生成时的完整代理树与计算结果快照；历史报表禁止回读 live Agent 关系。
model ProfitPoolAgentSnapshot {
  id     String          @id @default(cuid())
  poolId String          @map("pool_id")
  pool   ProfitPoolBatch @relation(fields: [poolId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)

  sourceAgentId       String  @map("source_agent_id")
  userId              String  @map("user_id")
  parentSourceAgentId String? @map("parent_source_agent_id")
  label               String
  uid                 String
  nickname            String?
  avatarUrl           String? @map("avatar_url")
  level               Int
  statusSnapshot      String  @map("status_snapshot")
  sharePointsSnapshot Int     @map("share_points_snapshot")
  bucketBaseSnapshot  Int     @map("bucket_base_snapshot")

  directAgentCount    Int      @default(0) @map("direct_agent_count")
  teamAgentCount      Int      @default(0) @map("team_agent_count")
  directPlayerCount   Int      @default(0) @map("direct_player_count")
  teamPlayerCount     Int      @default(0) @map("team_player_count")
  selfTurnoverCents   BigInt   @default(0) @map("self_turnover_cents")
  teamTurnoverCents   BigInt   @default(0) @map("team_turnover_cents")
  contributionBp      Int      @default(0) @map("contribution_bp")
  selfAmountCents     BigInt   @default(0) @map("self_amount_cents")
  overrideAmountCents BigInt   @default(0) @map("override_amount_cents")
  amountCents         BigInt   @default(0) @map("amount_cents")
  breakdown           Json?
  ledgerRef           String?  @unique @map("ledger_ref")
  createdAt           DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@unique([poolId, sourceAgentId])
  @@index([sourceAgentId, poolId])
  @@index([poolId, parentSourceAgentId])
  @@map("profit_pool_agent_snapshots")
}

/// 玩家归属与流水快照，仅用于代理本人历史看板；公司报表不展示玩家。
model ProfitPoolPlayerSnapshot {
  id     String          @id @default(cuid())
  poolId String          @map("pool_id")
  pool   ProfitPoolBatch @relation(fields: [poolId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)

  sourceAgentId String   @map("source_agent_id")
  userId        String   @map("user_id")
  uid           String
  nickname      String?
  avatarUrl     String?  @map("avatar_url")
  bindingSource String   @map("binding_source")
  isAgentSelf   Boolean  @default(false) @map("is_agent_self")
  turnoverCents BigInt   @default(0) @map("turnover_cents")
  profitCents   BigInt   @default(0) @map("profit_cents")
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@unique([poolId, userId])
  @@index([poolId, sourceAgentId])
  @@map("profit_pool_player_snapshots")
}

/// 从旧按日结算切换到按局结算时的安全边界；边界以内的局永不允许进入新池。
model ProfitPoolCutover {
  roomId    String   @id @map("room_id")
  room      Room     @relation(fields: [roomId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  maxSeqNo  Int      @default(0) @map("max_seq_no")
  source    String   @default("LEGACY_DAILY")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@map("profit_pool_cutovers")
}

/// 业务编号原子序列，key 形如 PROFIT_POOL:20260819。
model ProfitPoolSequence {
  key       String   @id
  value     Int      @default(0)
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@map("profit_pool_sequences")
}

model Leaderboard {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  gameCode     String   @default("SUPREME_NIUNIU") @map("game_code")
  type         String // points | hands | banker
  period       String // daily | weekly | monthly
  periodKey    String   @map("period_key") // 2026-08-06 / 2026-W32 / 2026-08
  rankSnapshot Json     @map("rank_snapshot")
  generatedAt  DateTime @default(now()) @map("generated_at")

  @@unique([gameCode, type, period, periodKey])
  @@index([gameCode, period, periodKey])
  @@map("leaderboards")
}

model Announcement {
  id          String    @id @default(cuid())
  title       String
  body        String
  imageUrl    String?   @map("image_url")
  target      String    @default("ALL")
  status      String    @default("DRAFT")
  pinned      Boolean   @default(false)
  scheduledAt DateTime? @map("scheduled_at")
  publishedAt DateTime? @map("published_at")
  createdBy   String?   @map("created_by")
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@index([status, scheduledAt])
  @@map("announcements")
}

/**
 * 小程序「系统通知」收件箱（运营可自定义群发）
 */
model SystemNotice {
  id           String             @id @default(cuid())
  title        String
  body         String
  audience     String             @default("ALL") // ALL | KYC_APPROVED | UIDS
  audienceUids Json               @default("[]") @map("audience_uids") // string[] UID
  status       String             @default("DRAFT") // DRAFT | PUBLISHED | ARCHIVED
  pushTelegram Boolean            @default(false) @map("push_telegram")
  publishedAt  DateTime?          @map("published_at")
  createdBy    String?            @map("created_by")
  createdAt    DateTime           @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt    DateTime           @updatedAt @map("updated_at")
  reads        SystemNoticeRead[]

  @@index([status, publishedAt])
  @@map("system_notices")
}

model SystemNoticeRead {
  id       String       @id @default(cuid())
  noticeId String       @map("notice_id")
  userId   String       @map("user_id")
  readAt   DateTime     @default(now()) @map("read_at")
  notice   SystemNotice @relation(fields: [noticeId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  user     User         @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@unique([noticeId, userId])
  @@index([userId, readAt])
  @@map("system_notice_reads")
}

model ChatMessage {
  id         String      @id @default(cuid())
  userId     String      @map("user_id")
  senderType ChatSender  @map("sender_type")
  type       MessageType @default(TEXT)
  content    String?
  assetUrl   String?     @map("asset_url")
  operatorId String?     @map("operator_id")
  readAt     DateTime?   @map("read_at")
  createdAt  DateTime    @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  user       User        @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@index([userId, createdAt])
  @@map("chat_messages")
}

enum ChatSender {
  USER
  SUPPORT
  SYSTEM
}

enum MessageType {
  TEXT
  EMOJI
  STICKER
  IMAGE
}

// ─────────────────────────── 群内玩家红包 / 打赏 ───────────────────────────

/// 玩家在互动群自发的余额红包（拼手气），领完或过期后结束
model GroupPacket {
  id             String   @id @default(cuid())
  roomId         String   @map("room_id")
  senderId       String   @map("sender_id")
  requestId      String   @map("request_id")
  totalCents     BigInt   @map("total_cents")
  count          Int
  remainingCents BigInt   @map("remaining_cents")
  remainingCount Int      @map("remaining_count")
  /**
   * RANDOM = 拼手气 / EQUAL = 平分
   */
  mode           String   @default("RANDOM")
  greeting       String   @default("恭喜发财，大吉大利")
  status         String   @default("ACTIVE") // ACTIVE / FINISHED / EXPIRED
  expiresAt      DateTime @map("expires_at")
  createdAt      DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  sender User               @relation("GroupPacketSender", fields: [senderId], references: [id])
  claims GroupPacketClaim[]

  @@unique([senderId, requestId])
  @@index([roomId, createdAt])
  @@index([status, expiresAt])
  @@map("group_packets")
}

model GroupPacketClaim {
  id          String   @id @default(cuid())
  packetId    String   @map("packet_id")
  userId      String   @map("user_id")
  amountCents BigInt   @map("amount_cents")
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  packet GroupPacket @relation(fields: [packetId], references: [id])
  user   User        @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id])

  @@unique([packetId, userId])
  @@map("group_packet_claims")
}

model StickerAsset {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  name      String
  url       String
  sortOrder Int      @default(0) @map("sort_order")
  status    String   @default("ACTIVE")
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@map("sticker_assets")
}

// ─────────────────────────── 推送 ───────────────────────────

model PushTemplate {
  id        String    @id @default(cuid())
  code      String    @unique // kyc_submitted / kyc_approved / reward_granted / announcement ...
  title     String
  body      String // 支持 {{变量}}
  createdAt DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  jobs      PushJob[]

  @@map("push_templates")
}

model PushJob {
  id          String        @id @default(cuid())
  templateId  String?       @map("template_id")
  botId       String?       @map("bot_id")
  audience    Json // {type: "all"|"kyc_approved"|"uids", uids?: []}
  payload     Json // 渲染后的变量
  scheduledAt DateTime?     @map("scheduled_at")
  status      String        @default("PENDING") // PENDING/SENT/FAILED
  createdBy   String?       @map("created_by")
  createdAt   DateTime      @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  template    PushTemplate? @relation(fields: [templateId], references: [id])
  logs        PushLog[]

  @@map("push_jobs")
}

model PushLog {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  jobId     String   @map("job_id")
  userId    String   @map("user_id")
  success   Boolean
  error     String?
  messageId BigInt?  @map("message_id")
  sentAt    DateTime @default(now()) @map("sent_at")
  job       PushJob  @relation(fields: [jobId], references: [id])

  @@index([jobId])
  @@map("push_logs")
}

// ─────────────────────────── 后台与配置 ───────────────────────────

model Admin {
  id           String    @id @default(cuid())
  username     String    @unique
  passwordHash String    @map("password_hash")
  tokenVersion Int       @default(0) @map("token_version")
  role         AdminRole @default(OPERATOR)
  status       String    @default("ACTIVE")
  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@map("admins")
}

enum AdminRole {
  SUPER
  OPERATOR
  REVIEWER
  FINANCE
}

model AuditLog {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  adminId   String   @map("admin_id")
  action    String
  target    String?
  before    Json?
  after     Json?
  ip        String?
  createdAt DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  @@index([adminId, createdAt])
  @@map("audit_logs")
}

model GameConfig {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  gameCode  String   @default("SUPREME_NIUNIU") @map("game_code")
  key       String
  value     Json
  updatedBy String?  @map("updated_by")
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@unique([gameCode, key])
  @@index([gameCode])
  @@map("game_configs")
}

/// 玩家可见的游戏规则说明；sections 只允许纯文本结构，不存储任意 HTML。
model GameRuleDocument {
  id          String    @id @default(cuid())
  gameCode    String    @unique @map("game_code")
  title       String
  summary     String    @default("")
  sections    Json      @default("[]")
  status      String    @default("PUBLISHED")
  version     Int       @default(1)
  updatedBy   String?   @map("updated_by")
  publishedAt DateTime? @map("published_at")
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@index([status])
  @@map("game_rule_documents")
}
